### GET qcms
GET http://localhost:3022/api/schistes


### GET par id
GET http://localhost:3022/api/schistes/1

###Creer un schistes
POST http://localhost:3022/api/schistes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "nom": "test",
    "origine": "test",
    "profondeur": 12,
    "description": "test du post"
  }
}

###Modifier un schistes totalement
PUT http://localhost:3022/api/schistes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "nom": "test",
    "origine": "test",
    "profondeur": 12,
    "description": "test du post"
  }
}

###Modifier un schistes partiellement
PATCH http://localhost:3022/api/schistes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "nom": "test",

  }
}

###Supprimer un schistes 
DELETE http://localhost:3022/api/schistes/1
Content-Type: application/json
